  "solution": "Given:\n\n78 ÷ 13 of 5 - [48 ÷ 72 × 3 - 15 ÷ 8 × (23 - 29) - 17] of 4\n\nConcept used:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/694d0d67bc14effd3a3679b70b4d77edef851107a6a53b64ea488e47e4c2bef5.png] \n\nCalculation:\n\n78 ÷ 13 of 5 - [48 ÷ 72 × 3 - 15 ÷ 8 × (23 - 29) - 17] of 4\n\n⇒ 78 ÷ 13 of 5 - [48 ÷ 72 × 3 - 15 ÷ 8 × -6 - 17] of 4\n\n⇒ 78 ÷ 13 of 5 - [48 ÷ 72 × 3 + 15 ÷ 8 × 6 - 17] of 4\n\n⇒ 78 ÷ 13 of 5 - [2/3 × 3 + 15/8 × 6 - 17] of 4\n\n⇒ 78 ÷ 13 of 5 - [2 + 45/4 - 17] of 4\n\n⇒ 78 ÷ 13 of 5 - [-15/4] of 4\n\n⇒ 78 ÷ 13 of 5 + 15/4 of 4\n\n⇒ 78 ÷ 65 + 15\n\n⇒ 1.2 + 15\n\n⇒ 16.2\n\n∴ The simplified value is 16.2.",
